OL,3,AFortnite-maker Epic Games confirms
OL,4,A'huge pivot' towards using AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FFortnite-maker Epic Games is making a
OL,7,F"huge pivot" towards using artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) in its video game
OL,9,Fdevelopment, according to boss Tim
OL,10,FSweeney.
OL,12,FThe US firm's CEO made the announcement
OL,13,Fon social media, saying developers are
OL,14,Fbeing moved to "retool for maximum AI
OL,15,Facceleration".
OL,17,FIt comes after Epic delayed the release
OL,18,Fof a collaboration with Disney
OL,19,Ffeaturing characters from Star Wars and
OL,20,FMarvel, according to a report from
OL,21,FBloomberg.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
